","Data Collection","Statistical Test","Effect Size","Interpretation","Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is especially valuable for Product Analyst roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Optional Machine Learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A Data Analyst does not need to become a full ML Engineer."},{"text":"However, a Mathematics graduate can benefit from basic ML."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Clustering"},{"text":"PCA fundamentals"},{"text":"Model evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"The focus should remain on interpretability and analytical usefulness, not simply model complexity."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how analytical data is structured."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relational databases"},{"text":"Primary keys"},{"text":"Foreign keys"},{"text":"Normalization"},{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"ETL/ELT concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"├──── Orders ──── Products"},{"text":"│"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["└──── Regions","Data Model","SQL","Power BI","Dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"}]},{"heading":"Business Sales Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build an end-to-end project using:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Python","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Regional performance"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Monthly trends"}]}]},{"heading":"Customer Churn Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"