","text":"2. Product Analyst"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Statistics","Experimentation","Product Metrics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent for technology companies."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Quantitative Analyst"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mathematics","Probability","Statistics","Programming","Finance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A more mathematically intensive route."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Risk Analyst"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","Probability","SQL","Financial/Operational Risk"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Suitable for banking, insurance and financial services."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Operations Analyst"},{"type":"flow","items":["Optimization","Statistics","SQL","Process Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent use of mathematical thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Data Scientist"},{"type":"p","text":"A natural long-term transition:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mathematics","Statistics","Python","ML","Data Science"]},{"type":"p","text":"This requires significantly deeper machine learning and programming than a conventional Data Analyst role."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Route 1 — General Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Mathematics","Data Analyst Intern","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Specialist","Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager","Head of Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 2 — Product Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Mathematics","Data Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Product Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager","Director of Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 3 — Quantitative Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Mathematics","Quantitative / Risk Analyst","Quantitative Analyst","Senior Quantitative Analyst","Quantitative Research / Analytics Lead","Quantitative Strategy Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 4 — Data Science"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Mathematics","Data Analyst","Advanced Analytics Analyst","Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","ML / Data Science Lead","Data Science Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-Assisted Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"AI tools increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL generation"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Statistical explanations"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But analysts still need to validate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["data quality","assumptions","calculations","conclusions."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"2. Automated Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"The analytics workflow is becoming increasingly automated:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Sources","Automated Pipelines","Data Quality","Automated Analysis","Anomaly Detection","AI-Assisted Interpretation","Human Validation","Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Analytics Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong advanced route for mathematically inclined graduates."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"ELT"},{"text":"dbt concepts"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Cloud analytics"},{"text":"This sits between Data Engineering and Data Analytics."}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Decision Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"An emerging area combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","Statistics","Optimization","AI","Decision Science"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly compatible with a Mathematics background."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Prescriptive Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond:"},{"type":"p","text":"What happened?"},{"type":"p","text":"and:"},{"type":"p","text":"Why did it happen?"},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"What should we do?"},{"type":"p","text":"Mathematical optimization becomes particularly valuable here."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DATA ANALYST"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"┌────────────────┼────────────────┐"},{"text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"text":"MATHEMATICS ANALYTICS TOOLS"},{"text":"│ │ │"},{"text":"Probability Statistics Excel"},{"text":"Statistics EDA SQL"},{"text":"Linear Algebra Regression Python"},{"text":"Optimization Forecasting Power BI"},{"text":"Modelling A/B Testing Tableau"},{"text":"│ │ │"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["└────────────────┼────────────────┘","BUSINESS ANALYTICS","DATA MODELLING","DECISION SUPPORT","DOMAIN SPECIALIZATION"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong B.Sc. Mathematics graduate targeting Data Analyst roles should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Apply probability and statistics to real datasets"},{"text":"Write advanced SQL queries"},{"text":"Clean and transform data using Python"},{"text":"Use pandas effectively"},{"text":"Perform exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Build professional Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Perform regression analysis"},{"text":"Conduct hypothesis tests"},{"text":"Design basic A/B tests"},{"text":"Analyse time-series data"},{"text":"Perform forecasting"},{"text":"Explain statistical results clearly"},{"text":"Understand relational data models"},{"text":"Translate business questions into analytical problems"},{"text":"Communicate recommendations to non-technical stakeholders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–7 substantial projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales & Profitability Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Churn Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics + A/B Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Time-Series Forecasting"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Optimization Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial/Risk Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematical Modelling + Real-World Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should follow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Data Collection","Data Cleaning","SQL / Python","Statistical Analysis","Visualization","Insight","Recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“A mathematically trained data analyst who combines probability, statistics, mathematical modelling, SQL, Python and business intelligence to transform complex datasets into reliable, actionable decisions.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Mathematics","Probability + Statistics","Excel","SQL","Python + pandas","Power BI","EDA + Statistical Analysis","Regression + Forecasting","Business Analytics","Internship","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Specialist","Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager / Data Strategy"]},{"type":"note","label":"Best long-term combination","text":"Mathematics + Statistics + SQL + Python + Power BI + Business Analytics + Experimentation + Forecasting + a specialized domain such as Product, Finance, Operations or Risk."}]}]}